  "bodyHash": "CQsoQFvctBk=",
  "content": "<p style=\"text-align:center\"><a href=\"/linkout?remoteUrl=https%253a%252f%252fserilum.com%252f\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"nofollow\"><img src=\"https://cdn.serilum.com/description/header/header.png\" alt=\"Serilum 模组。用心制作，大量适用于 Fabric、Forge 和 Neo 的活跃模组！\" width=\"838\" height=\"400\"></a></p><p style=\"text-align:center\"><a href=\"https://curseforge.com/members/serilum/projects\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"nofollow\"><img src=\"https://workflow.serilum.com/badges/svg/curseforge.svg\" alt=\"CurseForge\" width=\"200\"></a> <a href=\"/linkout?remoteUrl=https%253a%252f%252fmodrinth.com%252fuser%252fSerilum\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"nofollow\"><img src=\"https://workflow.serilum.com/badges/svg/modrinth.svg\" alt=\"Modrinth\" width=\"200\"></a> <a href=\"https://patreon.com/serilum\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"nofollow\"><img src=\"https://workflow.serilum.com/badges/svg/patreon.svg\" alt=\"Patreon\" width=\"200\"></a> <a href=\"https://youtube.com/@serilum\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"nofollow\"><img src=\"https://workflow.serilum.com/badges/svg/youtube.svg\" alt=\"YouTube\" width=\"200\"></a></p><h2><br><img src=\"https://cdn.serilum.com/description/nameplate/about-the-mod.svg\" alt=\"关于模组\" width=\"838\" height=\"64\"></h2><p><span style=\"font-size:18px\">治愈营火会在营火周围创建一个区域，玩家和/或被动生物会在该区域内获得再生效果，效果半径可配置。模组中的被动实体只要<em><span style=\"text-decoration:underline\">不是</span></em>被归类为 \"<em>EntityClassification.Monster</em>\" 也能被治愈。当实体剩余的再生效果持续时间过半且靠近营火时，效果持续时间会刷新。<br><br></span><strong><span style=\"color:#008000;font-size:16px\">在 1.16 版本中，<span style=\"color:#36f;font-size:16px\">灵魂营火</span>同样适用！此功能可配置。</span></strong><br>你可能也会对 <span style=\"color:#f90\"><strong><a style=\"color:#f90\" href=\"https://curseforge.com/minecraft/mc-mods/no-hostiles-around-campfire\" rel=\"nofollow\">营火附近无敌对生物</a></strong></span> 感兴趣。</p><h2><br><br><img src=\"https://cdn.serilum.com/description/nameplate/dependencies.svg\" alt=\"依赖项\" width=\"838\" height=\"64\"></h2><p><a href=\"https://curseforge.com/minecraft/mc-mods/collective\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"nofollow\"><img src=\"https://cdn.serilum.com/description/badges/dependencies/requires/collective.svg\" alt=\"需要 Collective\" width=\"251\" height=\"49\"></a><br><a href=\"https://curseforge.com/minecraft/modpacks/the-vanilla-experience\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"nofollow\"><img src=\"https://cdn.serilum.com/description/badges/dependencies/includes/the-vanilla-experience.svg\" alt=\"包含于原版体验整合包\" width=\"350\" height=\"49\"></a><a href=\"https://curseforge.com/minecraft/mc-mods/serilums-rpg-bundle\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"nofollow\"><img src=\"https://cdn.serilum.com/description/badges/dependencies/includes/rpg-bundle.svg\" alt=\"包含于 Serilum 的 RPG 整合包\" width=\"334\" height=\"49\"></a><br><img src=\"https://cdn.serilum.com/description/badges/environment/server.svg\" alt=\"运行环境：服务端\" width=\"220\" height=\"49\"></p><h2><br><br><br><img src=\"https://cdn.serilum.com/description/nameplate/configurable.svg\" alt=\"可配置\" width=\"838\" height=\"64\"></h2><p><a href=\"/linkout?remoteUrl=https%253a%252f%252fserilum.com%252fconfiguration-guide\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"nofollow\"><img src=\"https://cdn.serilum.com/description/badges/configuration-guide.svg\" alt=\"配置指南\" width=\"220\" height=\"49\"></a></p><p>&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;<span style=\"font-size:18px\">所有可用的配置选项：</span></p><div class=\"spoiler\" style=\"margin-left:10px;padding-left:10px\">\n<p><span style=\"font-size:14px\"><strong>checkForCampfireDelayInTicks</strong></span><span style=\"font-size:12px;color:#8a8d91\">&nbsp;&nbsp;默认 40，最小值 1，最大值 1200</span><br><span style=\"font-size:13px\">模组检查玩家周围营火的频率（单位：游戏刻）。1 秒 = 20 游戏刻，因此默认每 2 秒检查一次。</span><br><br><span style=\"font-size:14px\"><strong>healingRadius&nbsp;</strong></span><span style=\"font-size:12px;color:#8a8d91\">&nbsp;&nbsp;默认 16，最小值 1，最大值 64</span><br><span style=\"font-size:13px\">营火周围玩家获得再生效果的范围（单位：方块）。</span><br><br><span style=\"font-size:14px\"><strong>effectDurationSeconds</strong></span><span style=\"font-size:12px;color:#8a8d91\">&nbsp;&nbsp;默认 60，最小值 1，最大值 600</span><br><span style=\"font-size:13px\">营火所施加的再生效果的持续时间。</span><br><br><span style=\"font-size:14px\"><strong>regenerationLevel</strong></span><span style=\"font-size:12px;color:#8a8d91\">&nbsp;&nbsp;默认 1，最小值 1，最大值 50</span><br><span style=\"font-size:13px\">营火所施加的再生效果的等级，默认为 1。</span><br><br></p>\n<p><span style=\"font-size:14px\"><strong>healPassiveMobs&nbsp;</strong></span><span style=\"font-size:12px;color:#8a8d91\">&nbsp;&nbsp;默认 true</span><br><span style=\"font-size:13px\">启用后，营火会治疗其半径等于碰撞箱宽度一半范围内的被动生物。</span><br><br><span style=\"font-size:14px\"><strong>hideEffectParticles&nbsp;</strong></span><span style=\"font-size:12px;color:#8a8d91\">&nbsp;&nbsp;默认 true</span><br><span style=\"font-size:13px\">启用后，隐藏营火周围再生效果的粒子。</span><br><br></p>\n<p><span style=\"font-size:14px\"><strong>campfireMustBeLit</strong></span><span style=\"font-size:12px;color:#8a8d91\">&nbsp;&nbsp;默认 true</span><br><span style=\"font-size:13px\">启用后，营火只有在方块点亮时才会生效。</span><br><br><span style=\"font-size:14px\"><strong>campfireMustBeSignalling</strong></span><span style=\"font-size:12px;color:#8a8d91\">&nbsp;&nbsp;默认 false</span><br><span style=\"font-size:13px\">启用后，营火只有在方块输出信号时才会生效。</span><br><br></p>\n<p><span style=\"font-size:12px\"><em>仅1.16及以上版本的配置选项：</em></span><br><br><span style=\"font-size:14px\"><strong>enableEffectForNormalCampfires</strong></span><span style=\"font-size:12px;color:#8a8d91\">&nbsp;&nbsp;默认 true</span><br><span style=\"font-size:13px\">启用后，模组将对普通营火生效。</span><br><br><span style=\"font-size:14px\"><strong>enableEffectForSoulCampfires</strong></span><span style=\"font-size:12px;color:#8a8d91\">&nbsp;&nbsp;默认 true</span><br><span style=\"font-size:13px\">启用后，模组将对灵魂营火生效。</span></p>\n</div><h2><br><br><br><img src=\"https://cdn.serilum.com/description/nameplate/showcase.svg\" alt=\"展示\" width=\"838\" height=\"64\"></h2><p><span style=\"font-size:16px\">营火周围的再生效果：</span></p><div class=\"spoiler\">\n<p><img src=\"https://cdn.serilum.com/projects/healing-campfire/a.webp\" alt=\"\"></p>\n</div><h2><br><br><br><img src=\"https://cdn.serilum.com/description/nameplate/notes-n-links.svg\" alt=\"备注与链接\" width=\"838\" height=\"64\"></h2><p><span style=\"font-size:24px\"><strong>你可以在任何整合包中自由使用本模组，但下载链接必须保留在 CurseForge 或 Modrinth 生态内。</strong></span><br><br><span style=\"font-size:18px\"><a style=\"font-size:18px;color:#008000\" href=\"/linkout?remoteUrl=https%253a%252f%252fserilum.com%252f\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"nofollow\">Serilum.com</a> 包含所有可用模组的概览和更多信息。</span><br><br><span style=\"font-size:14px\">评论已关闭，因为我无法在如此多的独立模组页面中跟踪它们。</span><span style=\"font-size:14px\"><br>如有问题、想法、建议或其他任何事宜，请访问 <a style=\"font-size:14px;color:#008000\" href=\"https://github.com/Serilum/.issue-tracker\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"nofollow\">Github 仓库</a>。谢谢！</span><span style=\"font-size:6px\"><br><br></span></p>",
